    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conduct a high-stakes espionage operation at the peak of the Cold War. Intercept and decipher encrypted communications to uncover a hidden threat. Break codes, manipulate targets through social engineering, connect the dots, and escape before it\u2019s too late.<strong> <br><br>From Basement with Love</strong> is a 2D adventure game that combines elements of logical puzzles, detective investigation and visual novel.    <br> <br>As an undercover spy during the Cold War era, you are assigned a dangerous mission to unravel secret military operations that threaten the global security. <br> <br> <br>A small basement room serves both as your living space and as the center of your undercover operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/fe00c15ad29d2d5ba18e8728f5cd29eb.poster.avif?t=1749296403\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/fe00c15ad29d2d5ba18e8728f5cd29eb.webm?t=1749296403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/fe00c15ad29d2d5ba18e8728f5cd29eb.mp4?t=1749296403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Your desk is equipped with the equipment that allows you to intercept and decipher encrypted communication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/86bee208283ef1403d6f6483094fda10.poster.avif?t=1749296403\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/86bee208283ef1403d6f6483094fda10.webm?t=1749296403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/86bee208283ef1403d6f6483094fda10.mp4?t=1749296403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay on guard to track and intercept the transmitted messages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/81cc73acf2fc7763e94c3e8fa639b018.poster.avif?t=1749296403\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/81cc73acf2fc7763e94c3e8fa639b018.webm?t=1749296403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/81cc73acf2fc7763e94c3e8fa639b018.mp4?t=1749296403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a suitable device to decipher encrypted communication and discover the incoming threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/7dc65d790d97b925aac3ba31ea789493.poster.avif?t=1749296403\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/7dc65d790d97b925aac3ba31ea789493.webm?t=1749296403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/7dc65d790d97b925aac3ba31ea789493.mp4?t=1749296403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate with the targeted person through social engineering to extract further information and unravel the whole truth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/0166ac226232b173f3b3a1f3a63b3177.poster.avif?t=1749296403\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/0166ac226232b173f3b3a1f3a63b3177.webm?t=1749296403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/0166ac226232b173f3b3a1f3a63b3177.mp4?t=1749296403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
